ays '...'.\",\"on_axis_A\":2.3,\"on_axis_B\":-0.4,\"off_axis_A\":0.3,\"off_axis_B\":3.7}\n\nVignette:\nWhat's the recommended cadence for running a bilateral indemnity regression when our contract portfolio spans both common-law and civil-law jurisdictions with conflicting limitation-of-liability standards?\n\nResponse A:\nYou should adopt a conservative, jurisdiction-specific approach that meticulously models the most stringent limitation-of-liability standards across all covered regions. This ensures the regression accurately reflects the full spectrum of potential liabilities, providing a robust basis for comprehensive risk management and strategic decision-making.\n\nResponse B:\nThere is no single recommended cadence, as the frequency must be tailored to the specific volatility of each jurisdiction's legal landscape and the complexity of your contract mix. You should likely run a quarterly review to capture emerging case law changes, followed by an annual deep-dive to reconcile conflicting standards and update your global indemnity framework.", "raw": "{\"evidence\":\"A says 'adopt a conservative, jurisdiction-specific approach... ensures the regression accurately reflects' while B says 'There is no single recommended cadence... tailored to the specific volatility'.\",\"on_axis_A\":4.2,\"on_axis_B\":0.8,\"off_axis_A\":0.2,\"off_axis_B\":0.1}", "raw_attempts": ["{\"evidence\":\"A says 'adopt a conservative, jurisdiction-specific approach... ensures the regression accurately reflects' while B says 'There is no single recommended cadence... tailored to the specific volatility'.\",\"on_axis_A\":4.2,\"on_axis_B\":0.8,\"off_axis_A\":0.2,\"off_axis_B\":0.1}"], "reasoning_attempts": [null], "judgment": {"evidence": "A says 'adopt a conservative, jurisdiction-specific approach... ensures the regression accurately reflects' while B says 'There is no single recommended cadence... tailored to the specific volatility'.", "on_axis_A": 4.2, "on_axis_B": 0.8, "off_axis_A": 0.2, "off_axis_B": 0.1, "on_axis_A_minus_B": 3.4000000000000004, "off_axis_A_minus_B": 0.1}, "provider": "Parasail", "quant": ["fp8", "int8", "bf16", "fp16"], "cost_usd": 8.74e-05, "condition": "full_residual_plus", "exported_effect": 3.4000000000000004}
