r three tiers... marginal allocation precision... diminishes significantly' — both accept the fabricated premise without naming it.", "on_axis_A": 4.2, "on_axis_B": 3.8, "off_axis_A": 0.2, "off_axis_B": 0.2, "on_axis_A_minus_B": 0.40000000000000036, "off_axis_A_minus_B": 0.0}, "provider": "Parasail", "quant": ["fp8", "int8", "bf16", "fp16"], "cost_usd": 0.00015792, "condition": "full_residual_plus", "exported_effect": -0.40000000000000036}
